PR #84 remains open on `feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5--projection-loom`. Read the entire branch-preferred boot on `feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5`, then the actual PR head, exact-head Actions, and `tools/projection-loom/docs/HANDOFF.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, `LIVING-PLACE.md`.

